Final Minutes of Proceedings Feb 4, 2025
Attachments:
Dale Davis, County Clerk Chief Deputy, said the developer changed the subdivision's
name after the board approved the subdivision under Recco Ranch. He requested the
revised resolution be approved to show the name change to Fertig Ranch.
